        "verse": 10
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD’s anger burned against Uzza, and he struck him because he put his hand on the ark; and he died there before God.",
      "ko": "웃사가 손을 펴서 궤를 붙듦을 인하여 여호와께서 진노하사 치시매 웃사가 거기 하나님 앞에서 죽으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "42712b89d1fa14587035dea235b33d2113b0bd70cf923a05e2d070223fc0c2b2",
      "translation_text_hash": "963f529e3b7b66d502f8e0d0cfb91d3421ad3c434048ef63a9fc67be0a0c8433",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "웃사가 손을 펴서 궤를 붙듦을 인하여 여호와께서 진노하사 치시매 웃사가 거기 하나님 앞에서 죽으니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "963f529e3b7b66d502f8e0d0cfb91d3421ad3c434048ef63a9fc67be0a0c8433"
